#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:4
msgid "v4.2.1"
msgstr "v4.2.1"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.2.1 is a maintenance release that refreshes the bundled OpenMV firmware "
"to v4.5.8 across every supported board. It remains based on Qt Creator "
"10.0.1, and also adjusts the Windows code-signing script alongside the "
"version bump. There are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.2.1 是一个维护版本，将所有受支持开发板上随附的 OpenMV 固件更新至 v4.5.8。它仍基于 Qt Creator "
"10.0.1，并在版本号提升的同时调整了 Windows 代码签名脚本。没有破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware updated to v4.5.8** for all supported boards, so the IDE "
"ships the latest OpenMV firmware out of the box."
msgstr "**随附固件更新至 v4.5.8**\\ ，适用于所有受支持的开发板，因此 IDE 开箱即用地搭载最新的 OpenMV 固件。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:23
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:25
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled **OpenMV firmware** from v4.5.6 to v4.5.8 for all "
"supported boards (OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT, ``OPENMV_RT1060``, Arduino GIGA, Nano "
"RP2040 Connect, Nicla Vision, Portenta H7, and Nano 33 BLE Sense), including"
" the ``firmware.bin``/``.dfu``/``.uf2``/``.hex``, UVC, and bootloader "
"binaries (`4ef02d2a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4ef02d2a6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"将随附的 **OpenMV 固件** 从 v4.5.6 更新至 v4.5.8，适用于所有受支持的开发板（OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT、\\ "
"``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ 、Arduino GIGA、Nano RP2040 Connect、Nicla Vision、Portenta "
"H7 和 Nano 33 BLE Sense），包括 ``firmware.bin``/``.dfu``/``.uf2``/``.hex``\\ "
"、UVC 和引导加载程序二进制文件（\\ `4ef02d2a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4ef02d2a6>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:30
msgid ""
"Stopped code-signing bundled ``.dll`` files on Windows in "
"``scripts/sign.py``, signing only ``.exe`` binaries to reduce per-signature "
"costs (`9ff6990b8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ff6990b8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在 ``scripts/sign.py`` 中停止对 Windows 上随附的 ``.dll`` 文件进行代码签名，仅签名 ``.exe`` "
"二进制文件，以降低每次签名的成本（\\ `9ff6990b8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ff6990b8>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:35
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台与工具支持"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:37
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基础版本：** 10.0.1。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:38
msgid ""
"**OpenMV IDE version:** bumped to 4.2.1 (`85928e586 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/85928e586>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV IDE 版本：** 提升至 4.2.1（\\ `85928e586 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/85928e586>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:40
msgid "**OpenMV firmware:** v4.5.6 -> v4.5.8 for all supported boards."
msgstr "**OpenMV 固件：** 所有受支持的开发板从 v4.5.6 更新至 v4.5.8。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:43
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破坏性变更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.2.1.rst:45
msgid ""
"None. This release does not change any IDE workflows or behavior for "
"existing projects."
msgstr "无。本版本不会更改任何 IDE 工作流程，也不会更改现有项目的行为。"
